Grammar

    0 $accept: program $end

    1 program: declarations functions main_function

    2 main_function: SANKALPA LPAREN RPAREN LBRACE statements RBRACE

    3 declarations: /* empty */
    4             | declarations declaration SEMICOLON

    5 declaration: type IDENTIFIER
    6            | type IDENTIFIER ASSIGN expression

    7 functions: /* empty */
    8          | functions function_declaration

    9 function_declaration: YAJNA type IDENTIFIER LPAREN parameters RPAREN LBRACE statements RBRACE

   10 parameters: /* empty */
   11           | parameter_list

   12 parameter_list: parameter
   13               | parameter_list COMMA parameter

   14 parameter: type IDENTIFIER

   15 statements: /* empty */
   16           | statements statement

   17 statement: declaration SEMICOLON
   18          | assignment SEMICOLON
   19          | conditional
   20          | loop
   21          | for_loop
   22          | TYAGA SEMICOLON
   23          | NIVRITTI SEMICOLON
   24          | function_call SEMICOLON
   25          | MOKSHA expression SEMICOLON
   26          | input_output SEMICOLON

   27 assignment: IDENTIFIER ASSIGN expression

   28 conditional: DHARMA LPAREN expression RPAREN LBRACE statements RBRACE
   29            | DHARMA LPAREN expression RPAREN LBRACE statements ADHARMA LBRACE statements RBRACE

   30 loop: TAPAS LPAREN expression RPAREN LBRACE statements RBRACE

   31 for_loop: YATRA LPAREN for_initialization SEMICOLON expression SEMICOLON assignment RPAREN LBRACE statements RBRACE

   32 for_initialization: type IDENTIFIER ASSIGN expression
   33                   | assignment

   34 expression: term
   35           | expression YOGA term
   36           | expression VIYOGA term
   37           | expression VIBHAGA term
   38           | expression LT term
   39           | expression GT term
   40           | expression LE term
   41           | expression GE term
   42           | expression EQ term
   43           | expression NE term

   44 term: factor
   45     | term BAL factor
   46     | term VIBHAJAN factor
   47     | term SHESHA factor
   48     | term SAMAVAYA factor

   49 factor: LPAREN expression RPAREN
   50       | IDENTIFIER
   51       | literal
   52       | function_call

   53 literal: INTEGER_LITERAL
   54        | STRING_LITERAL
   55        | FLOAT_LITERAL

   56 function_call: AHVANA LPAREN arguments RPAREN

   57 arguments: /* empty */
   58          | argument_list

   59 argument_list: expression
   60              | argument_list COMMA expression

   61 input_output: SHRAVANA LPAREN IDENTIFIER RPAREN
   62             | MANTRA LPAREN expression RPAREN

   63 type: ARTHA
   64     | JALA
   65     | SATYA
   66     | AKSHARA
   67     | VANI


